window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A GAME OF THRONES MEETS THE LEGEND OF ZELDA in this medieval fantasy about women's resilience. </b></p> <p><b>In the wake</b> of a tragic accident that claimed her memory and her mother's life when she was just fourteen, Stella Aresun is haunted by a past shrouded in secrecy. Her attempts to recall the events are met with debilitating headaches and a wall of silence from everyone around her, including her own father. </p> <p><b>Eight years later</b>, as she steps into her role as heir, her world is shattered as a coup ravages its way through her home, propelling her into a flight for survival when she's forced to flee into the world. Stella plunges into the underbelly of society, and in her determination to keep her friends safe, she must decide how far she’s willing to go to secure the future of those she loves and reveal the dark secrets that have been buried in her kingdom and within her for far too long. </p> <p><b>Embark </b>on a journey of secrets, betrayal and self-discovery as Stella unearths the secrets at the heart of the kingdom she is next in line to rule.</p>"; 
